Value Required SYSTEM_ID (\S+)
Value LEVEL (L[12](?:L[12])?)
Value IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value HOLD_TIME (\d+)
Value CIRCUIT_ID (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+(?:\s+\S+)*)

Start
  ^\s*System\s+Id\s+Type\s+IP\s+Address\s+State\s+Holdtime\s+Circuit\s+Interface\s*$$ -> Neighbors

Neighbors
  ^\s*Area\s+\S+:\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*${SYSTEM_ID}\s+${LEVEL}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${STATE}\s+${HOLD_TIME}\s+${CIRCUIT_ID}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
